---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="bg-ink text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-32">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl" data-reveal>
      만들고 싶은 옷이 있다면,<br />
      <span class="text-accent">지금 이야기해 주세요.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-white/70" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">수량과 일정만 알려주시면 영업일 기준 1일 안에 견적을 드립니다.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 240ms">
      <a href="/contact" class="rounded-full bg-accent px-8 py-4 font-semibold transition-colors hover:bg-accent-dark">견적 문의하기</a>
      <a
        href={site.kakaoChannel}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="rounded-full border border-white/30 px-8 py-4 font-semibold transition-colors hover:bg-white hover:text-ink"
      >
        카카오톡 상담
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
